  "title": "JSON: Make it possible to disable JSON_3GPP handling",
  "description": "Check whether or not the JSON 3GPP protocol (or any other\nprotocol that registers decoding functions for certain keys)\nis enabled before calling the function.\n\nWhile many of the keys are unlikely to be used for other\npurposes, some other JSON may well have \"supportedFeatures\"\nas a key.\n\nA string or custom dissector table should probably be used instead,\nwhich would do the checking for us.",
